# Edit Safety

- Do not revert unrelated local changes unless explicitly requested.
- Do not run destructive git operations without explicit user approval.
- Preserve existing style and architecture unless task requires change.
- Keep diffs focused; avoid unrelated cleanup in the same pass.
- When behavior changes, add or update tests close to the change.

# Validation

- Run lint/test checks after substantive edits when feasible.
- If checks cannot run, state exactly what remains to verify.
